  "description": "INTO University of East Anglia (INTO UEA) is designed for student success. Our pathways are taught in a unique live-learn environment on a safe university campus, with progression to the University of East Anglia (UEA). Our students thrive at university and beyond with our tailored support. World top 200 university (Times Higher Education World University Rankings 2011–22).Over 79% of our students achieve a 1st or 2:1 (based on INTO UEA undergraduate students graduating in 2021).Located in Norwich – one of the best places to live in the UK (The Sunday Times ‘Best Places to Live’ 2021).96% of students feel safe and secure living at INTO UEA (INTO Annual Student Experience Survey 2022).95% student satisfaction with support; 94% student satisfaction with the learning experience (INTO Annual Student Experience Survey 2022).At INTO UEA, students can also take A levels through the INTO Newton A level Programme. Timestamps Updated",
